  "note": "Proxy = final bounding box in metres (w across X, d along forward +Y, h up), pivot at base centre. Generators must hit these dims. Unknown assets fall back to a 1 m cube and are flagged by checks. structural=true: built by the graybox/structure generators from layout.json, so no proxy box is placed. marker=true: shader/light marker, no proxy box (lights still emitted). frame=true: walk-through frame (portal arches, porches), exempt from the clearance check where the spine passes through it. deck=true: walkable deck proxy (slab at the top, open below). cluster_ok: may touch/interpenetrate other cluster_ok assets (rocks). host: lights and small props may sit inside it. hero_glow: when this asset is a hero its graybox proxy glows (light-like heroes); other heroes get clay + a key light. gb_emit: graybox glow colour/strength for light-like assets. stand_in: graybox object that stands for a marker hero (visibility check). slatted: deck rendered as boards with open gaps (Kawagiri, owner request).",
